      "content": "That's a very thoughtful question. You might say, \"People have learned a lot about Doubt, which is feeling comfortable exactly as they are, and about all the beautiful and different ways people can be, no matter what. Just like how not everyone walks in the same way, or eats the same, people can feel inside in different and wonderful ways that make their own.\" This explanation ties into their existing understanding and emphasizes kindness and acceptance.",
